WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.405
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.074
Well, it's 2024.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:10.143
And you know what happens
later this year.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:13.646
Oh, damn it!

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:17.583
I was gonna say the Olympics.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.351
At a campaign rally
in Iowa last week,

00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:21.887
former President Trump said that
President Biden,

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:24.424
"Can't put two sentences
together."

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.725
Um, have you heard him talk?

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:30.897
He can put, like, 100 together.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.465
The same rally
in Iowa last week,

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.867
former President Trump
said that the Civil War,

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:36.335
"could have been negotiated."

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:37.971
That was crazy enough,
but then he said

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:40.540
the Gettysburg Address
could have been an e-mail.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.111
Same rally, Trump also called
on President Biden

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.012
to release Capitol rioters
from prison.

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:48.848
And I guess it was
only a matter of time

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:54.787
before he settled on the same
campaign platform as the Joker.

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:57.323
Former UN Ambassador Nikki Haley
is facing criticism

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.592
after she recently
failed to cite slavery

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.094
as the leading cause
of the Civil War.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:04.964
And not only that, she's facing
a D in social studies.

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:08.701
According to a new report,

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.836
when the violence began to
escalate in the Capitol attack,

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:12.171
then President Trump was

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:14.607
"just not interested
in doing more to stop it."

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.943
Either that,
or he was exhausted

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.878
from everything
he had to do to start it.

00:01:20.979 --> 00:01:23.116
When asked yesterday
about reports that she could be

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.550
former President Trump's
running mate

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.886
in 2024,
Republican Congresswoman

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.821
Elise Stefanik said
she would be,

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:30.723
"honored to serve
in any capacity

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.158
in a Trump administration."

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:36.229
Well, I'm pretty sure First Lady
is gonna be up for grabs.

00:01:38.363 --> 00:01:39.698
Apple announced today

00:01:39.698 --> 00:01:41.967
that his Vision Pro headset
will launch next month.

00:01:41.967 --> 00:01:43.703
This news first reported
on your hand,

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:48.107
your wrist, your lap
and pretty soon, your face.

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:52.344
After their dog recently ate
an envelope filled with $4,000,

00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:56.115
a couple in Pennsylvania
was able to recover $3,500

00:01:56.115 --> 00:01:57.850
in cash.

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:01.020
Said their friends,
"You can just Venmo me."

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.090
Taco Bell has begun offering

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:07.259
Crunchwrap Supreme meal kits
at Walmart,

00:02:07.259 --> 00:02:08.561
which include tortillas,

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:10.729
crunchy tostada shells,
taco seasoning,

00:02:10.729 --> 00:02:11.997
and Velveeta cheese sauce.

00:02:11.997 --> 00:02:13.199
You can cook it at home,

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.869
then take it right out
to your car to eat it.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:20.206
The largest radio company
in the country

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.675
announced over the weekend that
it has filed for bankruptcy.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.876
If you haven't heard about it,

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:27.513
it's because they announced
it on the radio.

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:29.849
A man in Alabama
was arrested recently

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:32.017
after he allegedly crashed
his car outside

00:02:32.017 --> 00:02:34.086
of a Bass Pro shop,
took off his clothes

00:02:34.086 --> 00:02:36.022
and jumped into
the store's aquarium.

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:37.656
But I'm not gonna
make a joke about that

00:02:37.656 --> 00:02:39.024
because it's low-hanging fruit.

00:02:39.024 --> 00:02:42.128
Actually
after he jumped in the water,

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.397
it became high-hanging fruit.

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:53.172
Anybody who doesn't get it,
stay after

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:54.641
and we'll, like, do a...

00:02:56.742 --> 00:03:00.046
Baz, I think told me
he drew a diagram.

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:04.617
We should offer more,
like, stay after

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.519
if you didn't get
any of the jokes.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.090
Someone over there has got
a very stern face.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.725
Keep them after.

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:19.299
And we'll be the only
talk show with detention.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:24.437
And finally, the CDC has issued
a recall

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:27.539
for more than 11,000 pounds
of ready-to-eat meat products,

00:03:27.539 --> 00:03:30.509
11,000 pounds of meat
or, as it's also known,

00:03:30.509 --> 00:03:31.844
an Arby's Kid Meal.

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:33.946
Well, there we go.

00:03:33.946 --> 00:03:35.248
Now you know it's a new year.

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:38.550
We've turned over
a new leaf on Arby's.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:41.287
Hearing his speech
in South Carolina yesterday,

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.989
President Biden criticized
former President Trump

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:45.824
for attempting
to overturn the election

00:03:45.824 --> 00:03:47.627
and called him a "loser."

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:51.630
Oh, come on, what has Trump
ever lost besides an airline,

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.233
his hotel, his golf course,
the popular vote twice,

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:56.502
the electoral vote once,
two wives, a casino,

00:03:56.502 --> 00:04:00.106
most of his hair and his mind?

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.773
According to a newly
released document,

00:04:01.773 --> 00:04:03.943
a Jeffrey Epstein accuser

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:05.745
claimed to have copies
of sex tapes

00:04:05.745 --> 00:04:07.980
Epstein has made of former
President Trump.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:11.584
And like most porn, it starts
with him ordering a pizza.

00:04:13.385 --> 00:04:14.654
That's right.

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:16.823
A Jeffrey Epstein accuser
claimed to have a sex tape

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:19.091
of former President Trump --
I don't know.

00:04:19.091 --> 00:04:22.295
I think if there was a sex tape,
we would have seen it by now...

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.230
in a Trump campaign ad.

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:30.703
[ As Trump ] I'm Donald Trump
and I approve of this porno.

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:32.037
[ Normal voice ]
A man in Portland

00:04:32.037 --> 00:04:35.107
recently found a working iPhone
along the side of a road

00:04:35.107 --> 00:04:38.243
that is believed to have been on
board the Alaskan Airlines plane

00:04:38.243 --> 00:04:40.846
that had a door plug
blow off mid-flight.

00:04:40.846 --> 00:04:43.149
And honestly, I'm not sure
what's scarier --

00:04:43.149 --> 00:04:45.050
having the door
blow off your plane

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.086
or losing your phone.

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:52.492
84-year-old Maryland
Congressman Steny Hoyer

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:54.760
