on surrogacy.

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:13.579
Okay. But it seemed to work out
for you in the past.

00:05:20.986 --> 00:05:24.023
A truck driver from Illinois was
recently reunited with his cat,

00:05:24.023 --> 00:05:27.193
