and ignored the rule of law."

00:05:55.387 --> 00:05:56.556
Huh?

00:05:56.556 --> 00:05:59.225
Wonder if Trump heard that...
from court.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.362
One more sketch of this guy

00:06:02.362 --> 00:06:04.897
and we can make
an animated series.

00:06:06.365 --> 00:06:07.866
In his remarks

00:06:07.866 --> 00:06:09.301
after his presidential
immunity hearing yesterday,

00:06:09.301 --> 00:06:12.270
former President Trump claimed
that if he was in office,

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:14.906
there would be no war
in Ukraine or Israel. Really?

00:06:14.906 --> 00:06:18.311
You couldn't even keep America
from attacking itself.

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:22.215
Trump also said
that there would be,

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:24.850
