if he's prosecuted."

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:26.084
Oh, I'm sure he's right.

00:06:26.084 --> 00:06:27.586
Parade floats blocking traffic,

00:06:27.586 --> 00:06:29.555
a massive champagne shortage.

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:31.056
You wouldn't be able
to walk a block

00:06:31.056 --> 00:06:32.558
