the other guy is too old.

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:45.037
Not a lot of teens
using "bedlam."

00:06:46.839 --> 00:06:48.573
New Jersey Senator
Robert Menendez

00:06:48.573 --> 00:06:50.175
