"Just saw your last picture.

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:26.005
Totally bedlam."

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:32.211
In a new interview,
actor Kevin Hart

00:08:32.211 --> 00:08:34.714
said that he's in a group chat
with action-movie stars,

00:08:34.714 --> 00:08:37.516
including Harrison Ford,
Tom Cruise and Jackie Chan.

00:08:37.516 --> 00:08:39.785
But I'll bet I can guess all
their group-chat personalities.

00:08:39.785 --> 00:08:41.387
Kevin Hart makes all the jokes.

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:44.923
Tom Cruise is the guy who uses
way too many exclamation points.

00:08:44.923 --> 00:08:46.992
Jackie Chan puts a "Ha ha"
on everything,

00:08:46.992 --> 00:08:50.296
and Harrison Ford
is not on that chat.

00:08:54.433 --> 00:08:56.202
[ Grumbling ]

00:08:59.105 --> 00:09:02.307
And finally, the brewer of
Miller Lite announced yesterday

00:09:02.307 --> 00:09:04.309
