new beer-flavored mints.

00:09:04.309 --> 00:09:05.644
And if that goes well,

00:09:05.644 --> 00:09:09.748
they might even start
offering beer-flavored beer.

00:09:09.748 --> 00:09:11.783
Former new Jersey Governor
Chris Christie

00:09:11.783 --> 00:09:13.152
announced yesterday

00:09:13.152 --> 00:09:15.120
that he is ending
his presidential campaign

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:17.189
less than a week
before the Iowa caucuses.

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:21.027
That means last place
is now up for grabs.

00:09:22.795 --> 00:09:25.530
The judge overseeing
his civil fraud trial today

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:28.667
allowed former President Trump
to speak for five minutes

00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:31.370
after his legal team finished
their closing arguments,

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:35.141
and now he's facing
11 more counts of fraud.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.844
Before he allowed
former President Trump

00:09:38.844 --> 00:09:41.881
to address the court today,
Judge Arthur Engoron asked,

00:09:41.881 --> 00:09:44.816
"Do you promise to just comment
on the facts and the law?"

00:09:44.816 --> 00:09:46.885
Good luck.
That's like asking Jake,

00:09:46.885 --> 00:09:50.156
"Do you promise you won't
talk about State Farm?"

00:09:52.124 --> 00:09:54.326
During a Fox News
town hall last night,

00:09:54.326 --> 00:09:56.328
former President Trump
took credit for overturning

00:09:56.328 --> 00:09:57.963
Roe versus Wade.

00:09:57.963 --> 00:10:01.968
Because, look, if he's got
to keep his kids, so do you.

00:10:10.475 --> 00:10:11.677
At last night's town hall,

00:10:11.677 --> 00:10:13.579
former President Trump
repeated his claim

00:10:13.579 --> 00:10:15.013
that Florida governor
Ron DeSantis

00:10:15.013 --> 00:10:17.082
would be working in a pizzeria

00:10:17.082 --> 00:10:19.552
or a law firm
without his support.

00:10:19.552 --> 00:10:21.487
And the fact that he thinks
those two jobs

00:10:21.487 --> 00:10:25.758
are similar explains a lot
about his legal team.

00:10:27.425 --> 00:10:29.361
[ As Trump ] "I found this guy.
He was at a pizza place.

00:10:29.361 --> 00:10:32.231
Now he's my lawyer."

00:10:32.231 --> 00:10:33.299
[ Normal voice ]
Trump also said he knows

00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:34.799
who he wants to be
his running mate,

00:10:34.799 --> 00:10:36.635
but added,
"I can't tell you that."

00:10:36.635 --> 00:10:37.736
Well, of course not.

00:10:37.736 --> 00:10:39.639
You'd be putting
their life in danger.

00:10:41.573 --> 00:10:43.975
House Speaker Mike Johnson said
during an interview yesterday

00:10:43.975 --> 00:10:46.211
that he's planning on calling
former President Trump

00:10:46.211 --> 00:10:49.815
to walk him through his spending
deal with Senate Democrats.

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:51.116
God, what are you
gonna do next?

00:10:51.116 --> 00:10:54.020
Walk a pigeon through Algebra?

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.522
Guess which one's
gonna take less time?

00:10:57.756 --> 00:11:00.292
And "F" train derailed
yesterday in Brooklyn,

00:11:00.292 --> 00:11:03.929
causing several hours
of normal "F" train service.

00:11:07.165 --> 00:11:09.568
It was the same,
but with a reason.

00:11:11.536 --> 00:11:13.906
The technology company
Augmental unveiled

00:11:13.906 --> 00:11:15.974
