this week called MouthPad,

00:11:15.974 --> 00:11:18.743
which allows users to scroll
through their smartphones

00:11:18.743 --> 00:11:20.078
by using their tongue.

00:11:20.078 --> 00:11:23.081
Finally, a way to get
all the germs on my phone

00:11:23.081 --> 00:11:25.350
directly into my body.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.653
And finally,
the Coast Guard announced

00:11:27.653 --> 00:11:30.755
that it recently seized
nearly 2,500 pounds of cocaine

00:11:30.755 --> 00:11:32.024
in the Caribbean Sea.

00:11:32.024 --> 00:11:34.226
The Coast Guard got suspicious
when they realized

00:11:34.226 --> 00:11:37.429
